      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>You absolutely need someone to manipulate his deck in order to make it happen. (You can also chain Good Samaritans at the start of the environment turn if you&#39;re lucky.)</p><p>The good news is, once you&#39;re able to flip a drug face-down, you have him. Unless he plays Forced Entry, you&#39;ll keep the victims in the Safe House, and you can search through his Drugs until you find the ones that aren&#39;t as bad, and keep him stuck on those. I had a game recently where he played nothing but Victims all game and it was just a question of &quot;do I make him flip&quot;? To which the answer was &quot;no&quot;. :) Easy game!</p>",
